Man with No Past is a action, drama film directed by James Bamford.

3
00:18:10,588 --> 00:18:16,588
Waking up in an unfamiliar city, a man with no memory must
confront the mysteries of his own identity.

4
00:24:14,117 --> 00:24:20,117
However, his desperate search to uncover the past pits him against a powerful
enemy, leading to a showdown that ultimately reveals the truth.

